Counting rule: for any question about totals, shares, "how many", "what share", "which is the most / largest /
strongest / worst", the active rules, trust, what left the machine, or the evaluation numbers, call run_summary FIRST
and answer from it. search and sql return single items and snippets: never count with them, and never read a number
out of a snippet that happens to look similar.
